Trademarks
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, community-maintained client library. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by the owner of Grafana Tempo
(Grafana Labs). Grafana Tempo is a trademark of its owner (Grafana Labs);
all other product names, logos and brands are the property of their respective
owners and are used for identification purposes only.

The Grafana Tempo server itself is licensed separately by its owner:
AGPL-3.0-only, with Apache-2.0 exceptions (`pkg/tempopb`, `operations/`).
This SDK contains no Grafana Tempo server code; it talks to the service over its
public network API (OTLP for ingest, the HTTP query API for reads). The response
models are written by hand from the JSON that the public HTTP API returns; no
Tempo source files, Go packages or protobuf definitions (including the
Apache-2.0 pkg/tempopb definitions) are copied, generated from or linked into
the packages. Trace data is exported with the OpenTelemetry OTLP exporters, whose
protobuf definitions come from the OpenTelemetry project (Apache-2.0).

The Docker integration harness (docker/tempo/Dockerfile, test-only, not part of
any published package) downloads the official Grafana Tempo release binary
(AGPL-3.0-only) at build time and runs it unmodified as a separate process.

